From 7286a0bf5d25898574f2cfbdbc357249403d2130 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MrBoogus <90836807+MrBoogus@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 12:18:41 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] hf: add Magic card detection, MFC auditor, air sniffer,
 and ISO15693/iClass

- In read_hf14a_page: add Magic card identification (Gen1a, Gen1b, Gen2/CUID,
  Gen3 APDU, Gen4 GTU/GDM, Magic NTAG, SuperCard), static nonce detection,
  direct Flipper native NFC export (/ext/nfc/PM5_<UID>.nfc), and Magic cloner.
- Add hf_mf_audit_page: hardware-accelerated MIFARE Classic 1K dictionary auditor
  with interactive 16-sector visual key matrix and complete sector dump export.
- Add hf_sniff_page: FPGA air sniffer for passive ISO14443A captures with trace
  download, protocol frame parser (R> Reader / T< Tag), and raw trace export.
- Add read_hf_multi_page: dual-mode HF reader for ISO15693 (NFC-V) 8-byte UID
  and HID iClass / PicoPass CSN and e-Purse CC.
